The '''Stone Parrot''' is a decorative piece of [[furniture]] that can be purchased on [[Winter|Winter 16]] from the [[Night Market#Magic Shop Boat|Magic Shop Boat]] at the [[Night Market]] for {{Price|500}}.  The statue can be placed anywhere in Stardew Valley, indoors or out.

==History==
{{History|1.3.27|Introduced.}}
{{History|1.4|Can now be stacked in a player's [[inventory]] and in [[Chest|chests]].}}

